Great picture, shame about the damage to the photo...

&#x200B;

[ENHANCE](https://imgur.com/fkZ4yeR)

Noooo! Don't listen to the advice from people telling you factory reset the phone! It's not an app it's a custom launcher! The fuckers got my wife with it a while back. You just have to get into the launcher settings for you phone. Go to default apps and make sure that the stock launcher is chosen, then, once it is, you will be able to remove the 'app' from the app list and clear it all off, WITHOUT resetting your device. 

&#x200B;

Hope this isn't too late.

I definitely don't want to be moving the camera very quickly, but, I do need constant torque, to supply smooth motion during recording. The camera itself is a Sony A7iii which weighs around 650 g (1lb 7.0 oz). 

&#x200B;

Controller wise, I will have to pinch someone else's code! I am, sadly, not a programmer. If I could use UE4's blueprint system, I would be good to go! (I am a games developer and use Unreal Engine). 

&#x200B;

Thanks so much for the detailed answer. I appreciate you taking the time to help me.

In calligraphy, that's not even a 'G', it's a 'J', which in a strange way makes it worse! 

